 "notes": [
  "Upper Division Requirements\nStudents must complete a total of eight courses within the department. There are five main subfields in the department: American Politics, Comparative Politics, Empirical Theory & Quantitative Methods , Political Theory and International Relations. Students must choose one subfield specialization to complete. Subfield distribution requirements can be completed with lower division OR upper division courses. Upper division courses fulfilling subfield specialization requirements and any remaining subfield distribution requirements also count toward satisfying the eight required upper division courses."
